Notes on third-party components:

* AVTrack model / training code: https://github.com/wuyou3474/AVTrack (MIT, see above).
* Backbone (DeiT-Tiny) pretrained weights: https://github.com/facebookresearch/deit (Apache-2.0).
* The converted weights in the Release assets are derived from an AVTrack checkpoint
  trained on LaSOT / GOT10K / COCO / TrackingNet. Those datasets have their own
  licenses; the released weights are intended for research use. No dataset images
  are redistributed here.
